E
horn bone crafted~
This huge horn is nearly three feet in length and apparently carved from
a solid piece of bone which you do not recognize. It tapers from a one
inch hole on the small end to a two foot hole on the larger end. A fine
silver chain, glowing with a pulsing blue light, attaches the horn to
a massive wooden post and defies all attempts at pulling the bone horn
free of its place on the pole. A faint inscription can also be seen on
the outside surface of the horn.
~
E
inscription writing~
The inscription reads:

"Mortal travelers within these desolate realms need but sound the
 Horn of the river to call forth the boatkeeper. But be prepared
 to pay his fee, for travelling the raging waters of the River
 Styx is not without its cost....and its risks.... "
~
